@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 002 Guided Notes 匯入：組件圖（概念層）

actor 老師
component "老師端畫面" as TeacherUI
cloud "Google Sheets\n（知道連結者可檢視）" as GS

package "搶答系統（伺服器）" {
  component "匯入入口\n(Import Gateway)" as Gateway
  component "試算表取得\n(Sheet Fetcher)" as Fetcher
  component "學習單解析\n(Guided Notes Parser)" as Parser
  component "匯入驗證\n(Import Validator)" as Validator
  component "題目庫\n(Question Bank)" as Bank
  component "活動階段管理\n（001）" as Phase
  database "活動資料儲存" as Store
}

老師 --> TeacherUI
TeacherUI --> Gateway : 連結或 xlsx 檔
Gateway --> Phase : 檢查老師身分與「準備中」
Gateway --> Fetcher : 以連結取得試算表
Fetcher --> GS : 下載為試算表檔
Gateway --> Parser : 試算表內容
Parser --> Validator : 題目與空格
Validator --> Gateway : 摘要或錯誤
Gateway --> TeacherUI : 匯入摘要／錯誤說明
TeacherUI --> Gateway : 確認匯入
Gateway --> Bank : 取代題目
Bank --> Store : 保存題目、空格位置、原檔

note right of Parser
  依表頭「題號／題目／作答」
  與合併範圍定位，
  不使用固定儲存格位置
end note
@enduml
